 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t an objectively “best” Atlanta car-accident lawyer—the right choice depends on your injuries, the facts, and how the attorney handles cases like yours. One reasonable starting point is to compare attorneys listed in **Super Lawyers’ Atlanta motor-vehicle-accident directory**; its listings are a screening resource, not a guarantee of results.\n\nBefore hiring anyone, speak with two or three firms and ask:\n\n- Who will personally handle my case, and how often will I hear from them?\n- Have you handled cases with injuries and circumstances like mine?\n- What is your contingency fee, and what case costs might I owe?\n- Would you take the case to trial if a fair settlement isn’t offered?\n\nCheck the attorney’s Georgia Bar status and read the fee agreement carefully. Many firms offer free consultations, so you can compare without committing. This isn’t a legal endorsement or a substitute for advice about your specific case.",
